  "account": "开卷读书",
  "source_title": "好好珍惜，珍惜身体，珍惜眼前人，珍惜生活的每一天。送别刘欢老师，歌声犹在，斯人远去。#情感#刘欢#智慧人生#人生感悟#珍惜",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_e24346b823344654_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 163.44381,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "刘欢老师走了，享年六十三岁。听到这个消息，我简直不敢相信，怎么一个好好的人说走就走了呢？毕竟才退休三年啊，正是享福的好日子，他唱了很多好听的歌曲，比如好汉歌、弯弯的月亮、少年壮志不言愁已经成为了一代又一代人心目中永恒的回忆。最近啊令人震惊的消息真的是太多了。半个月前，主持人金一丹老师走了，前几天济公的扮演者游本昌老师也走了。或许我们真的是到年纪了，到了目送那些伴随我们成长，带给我们欢乐，遇到啥事总能第一时间拨通电话的人离开的年纪，我同样也经历过至亲的离去，总觉得生命无常。每次目送一个人离开，总觉得自己好像往前走了一排似的。所以啊作为活着的人，我们到底该怎么做呢？其实无非就两个字，珍惜第一，珍惜身体。人这一辈子啊，除了健康，什么都不是你的，少内耗，少计较，少生气，百病生于器。只要你不生气，你就很难生病，有个好身体比什么都重要。第二就是珍惜眼前人。我们这一辈子啊和你具有亲密关系。很重要的人，无非就是爱人。孩子父母三两知己，掰着手指头数一数，也就是那么几个，真的不多。所以啊请你一定要远离消耗你的人，好好珍惜眼前人就行，不要等到失去了才懂得珍惜，也不要等到告别了，才懂得珍重。第三就是珍惜生活，珍惜你现在每一个能蹦能跳的好日子。其实这都是上天给予你的限量版好用的东西，你就多用，喜欢穿的衣服你就多穿。别总当个宝想去的地方，推门就去，别等以后等将来等有空等着等着，可能到最后你什么都不想要了。人生啊，不要总以为，来日方长，其实都是世事无常，好好珍惜享受。现在既是对自己，也是对家人，最后祝愿屏幕前的每一个人幸福、健康、平安，也祝愿刘欢老师一路走好。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00001",
      "start_ms": 210,
      "end_ms": 1290,
      "text": "刘欢老师走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1590,
      "end_ms": 2790,
      "text": "享年六十三岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3270,
      "end_ms": 4170,
      "text": "听到这个消息，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4810,
      "end_ms": 6090,
      "text": "我简直不敢相信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6650,
      "end_ms": 9190,
      "text": "怎么一个好好的人说走就走了呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9550,
      "end_ms": 11110,
      "text": "毕竟才退休三年啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11490,
      "end_ms": 13030,
      "text": "正是享福的好日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13490,
      "end_ms": 15130,
      "text": "他唱了很多好听的歌曲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00009",
      "start_ms": 15330,
      "end_ms": 23190,
      "text": "比如好汉歌、弯弯的月亮、少年壮志不言愁已经成为了一代又一代人心目中永恒的回忆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00010",
      "start_ms": 24270,
      "end_ms": 27210,
      "text": "最近啊令人震惊的消息真的是太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00011",
      "start_ms": 27410,
      "end_ms": 28170,
      "text": "半个月前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00012",
      "start_ms": 28670,
      "end_ms": 30600,
      "text": "主持人金一丹老师走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00013",
      "start_ms": 30900,
      "end_ms": 34780,
      "text": "前几天济公的扮演者游本昌老师也走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00014",
      "start_ms": 35700,
      "end_ms": 38680,
      "text": "或许我们真的是到年纪了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00015",
      "start_ms": 39440,
      "end_ms": 42320,
      "text": "到了目送那些伴随我们成长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00016",
      "start_ms": 42560,
      "end_ms": 43580,
      "text": "带给我们欢乐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00017",
      "start_ms": 43860,
      "end_ms": 48180,
      "text": "遇到啥事总能第一时间拨通电话的人离开的年纪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00018",
      "start_ms": 48740,
      "end_ms": 51220,
      "text": "我同样也经历过至亲的离去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00019",
      "start_ms": 51780,
      "end_ms": 53680,
      "text": "总觉得生命无常。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00020",
      "start_ms": 55120,
      "end_ms": 57280,
      "text": "每次目送一个人离开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00021",
      "start_ms": 57980,
      "end_ms": 61545,
      "text": "总觉得自己好像往前走了一排似的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00022",
      "start_ms": 62380,
      "end_ms": 64120,
      "text": "所以啊作为活着的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00023",
      "start_ms": 64320,
      "end_ms": 65815,
      "text": "我们到底该怎么做呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00024",
      "start_ms": 66340,
      "end_ms": 67675,
      "text": "其实无非就两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00025",
      "start_ms": 68120,
      "end_ms": 69650,
      "text": "珍惜第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00026",
      "start_ms": 69830,
      "end_ms": 70710,
      "text": "珍惜身体。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00027",
      "start_ms": 71270,
      "end_ms": 72370,
      "text": "人这一辈子啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00028",
      "start_ms": 72550,
      "end_ms": 73545,
      "text": "除了健康，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00029",
      "start_ms": 74010,
      "end_ms": 75110,
      "text": "什么都不是你的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00030",
      "start_ms": 75650,
      "end_ms": 76290,
      "text": "少内耗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00031",
      "start_ms": 76650,
      "end_ms": 77410,
      "text": "少计较，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00032",
      "start_ms": 77510,
      "end_ms": 78305,
      "text": "少生气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00033",
      "start_ms": 78640,
      "end_ms": 79745,
      "text": "百病生于器。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00034",
      "start_ms": 80340,
      "end_ms": 81335,
      "text": "只要你不生气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00035",
      "start_ms": 81730,
      "end_ms": 82870,
      "text": "你就很难生病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00036",
      "start_ms": 83370,
      "end_ms": 85885,
      "text": "有个好身体比什么都重要。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00037",
      "start_ms": 86250,
      "end_ms": 88845,
      "text": "第二就是珍惜眼前人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00038",
      "start_ms": 89190,
      "end_ms": 91710,
      "text": "我们这一辈子啊和你具有亲密关系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00039",
      "start_ms": 91710,
      "end_ms": 92615,
      "text": "很重要的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00040",
      "start_ms": 92990,
      "end_ms": 94370,
      "text": "无非就是爱人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00041",
      "start_ms": 94610,
      "end_ms": 97175,
      "text": "孩子父母三两知己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00042",
      "start_ms": 97550,
      "end_ms": 98905,
      "text": "掰着手指头数一数，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00043",
      "start_ms": 99180,
      "end_ms": 100405,
      "text": "也就是那么几个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00044",
      "start_ms": 100770,
      "end_ms": 101435,
      "text": "真的不多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00045",
      "start_ms": 101880,
      "end_ms": 104625,
      "text": "所以啊请你一定要远离消耗你的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00046",
      "start_ms": 104980,
      "end_ms": 106640,
      "text": "好好珍惜眼前人就行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00047",
      "start_ms": 107020,
      "end_ms": 109375,
      "text": "不要等到失去了才懂得珍惜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00048",
      "start_ms": 109690,
      "end_ms": 111130,
      "text": "也不要等到告别了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00049",
      "start_ms": 111490,
      "end_ms": 112635,
      "text": "才懂得珍重。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00050",
      "start_ms": 113010,
      "end_ms": 115935,
      "text": "第三就是珍惜生活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00051",
      "start_ms": 116700,
      "end_ms": 119995,
      "text": "珍惜你现在每一个能蹦能跳的好日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00052",
      "start_ms": 120610,
      "end_ms": 124290,
      "text": "其实这都是上天给予你的限量版好用的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00053",
      "start_ms": 124290,
      "end_ms": 124930,
      "text": "你就多用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00054",
      "start_ms": 125270,
      "end_ms": 127250,
      "text": "喜欢穿的衣服你就多穿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00055",
      "start_ms": 127670,
      "end_ms": 130110,
      "text": "别总当个宝想去的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00056",
      "start_ms": 130250,
      "end_ms": 131055,
      "text": "推门就去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00057",
      "start_ms": 131440,
      "end_ms": 134785,
      "text": "别等以后等将来等有空等着等着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00058",
      "start_ms": 135280,
      "end_ms": 138115,
      "text": "可能到最后你什么都不想要了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00059",
      "start_ms": 138720,
      "end_ms": 139360,
      "text": "人生啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00060",
      "start_ms": 139620,
      "end_ms": 140515,
      "text": "不要总以为，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00061",
      "start_ms": 140930,
      "end_ms": 141730,
      "text": "来日方长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00062",
      "start_ms": 142250,
      "end_ms": 143610,
      "text": "其实都是世事无常，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00063",
      "start_ms": 144110,
      "end_ms": 146030,
      "text": "好好珍惜享受。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00064",
      "start_ms": 146030,
      "end_ms": 147870,
      "text": "现在既是对自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00065",
      "start_ms": 148090,
      "end_ms": 149165,
      "text": "也是对家人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00066",
      "start_ms": 149790,
      "end_ms": 155545,
      "text": "最后祝愿屏幕前的每一个人幸福、健康、平安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e24346b823344654_s00067",
      "start_ms": 155920,
      "end_ms": 160125,
      "text": "也祝愿刘欢老师一路走好。"
    }
  ],
